Heading to the bus once the rain clears. Quick note on hours and
networking.

<!-- TODO(jess): photo — drop into static/photos/log/networking-options-for-the-bus.<ext>, then an image reference with a one-line credit -->

- Set tentative working hours: Thursday and Friday afternoons.
- Checking in on where the lease and entity work stand.
- Want to get networking routed to the bus.
- Favoring a simple household-style ISP hookup as the lowest-profile
  near-term option, once the legal pieces and J.'s blessing are in place.
- If folks are fine with the bus tapping an existing household
  connection, that can happen any time.
- Other options on the table: wireless point-to-point or fiber,
  piggybacking on an existing uplink. Both add complexity, so saved for
  later.
